# FireHOL IP Lists

> Public cybercrime IP feed observatory for discovering, comparing, and consuming maintained IP blocklists.

This file is a concise, public-only map of the site for AI agents. It links to human pages, public APIs, methodology, and feed artifacts. It does not describe private or operator-only surfaces.

## Primary Pages

- [Homepage and feed explorer](https://iplists.firehol.org): Main public surface for IP lookup and feed discovery.
- [Countries](https://iplists.firehol.org/countries): Country index for public feed matches.
- [ASNs](https://iplists.firehol.org/asns): ASN index for public feed matches.
- [Maintainers](https://iplists.firehol.org/maintainers): Maintainer index for public feeds.
- [Methodology](https://iplists.firehol.org/methodology): Explanations of feed metrics, health, overlap, retention, geography, ASN attribution, and insights.

## Public APIs

- [Service status](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/status): High-level public service state.
- [Categories](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/categories): Public category registry.
- [Feed catalog](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/sets): Public feed inventory.
- [Global IP search](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/search?ip=1.1.1.1): Query public feed membership for one IP address.
- [Countries API](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/countries): Published country summaries.
- [ASNs API](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/asns): Published ASN summaries.
- [Maintainers API](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/maintainers): Public maintainer summaries.
- [Methodology API](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/methodology): Machine-readable methodology index.
- [Compose API example](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/compose?include=sample&format=single): Public feed composition endpoint using include/exclude query parameters.

## Feed Surfaces

- [Legacy feed catalog JSON](https://iplists.firehol.org/all-ipsets.json): Bash-compatible public feed catalog.
- [Public feed API index](https://iplists.firehol.org/api/v1/sets): Canonical API entry point for feed metadata.
- [Example feed detail](https://iplists.firehol.org/ipsets/sample): Example public feed page; use the feed catalog for the full list.

## Optional

- [Sitemap](https://iplists.firehol.org/sitemap.xml): XML sitemap for public pages.
- [robots.txt](https://iplists.firehol.org/robots.txt): Crawler policy and sitemap pointer.
